From c4c6c3643efed8a17f1ef31e8991d9ce1e25f891 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Min Chen <vanderchen@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 14:32:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(scheduler): add unified topology placement planner

Introduce bounded rollback-capable topology planning with exact physical-node scopes, hard constraint composition, soft ordering, and compatibility rollout modes. Make speculative statement and task-topology callbacks reversible, and cover legacy compatibility, plugin effects, and backtracking behavior.
